        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5o6",
          "text": "Taking a bus to school, work or simply to get around Denver should not end in a serious accident. Yet this is exactly what can happen when a bus driver, school or bus company is negligent. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5o8",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l5o7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5o9",
          "text": ", our attorneys help bus accident victims determine why a crash happened, who is responsible and what their legal rights might be. We are committed to helping crash victims in Colorado seek the justice and financial compensation that they deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5oc",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ob",
          "text": "How a Denver Bus Accident Lawyer Can Help",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5oe",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5od",
          "text": "Hiring a bus accident lawyer to take your case can allow you to rest and focus on your recovery while an experienced professional handles complicated legal tasks for you. This can include going up against a bus company or its insurance carrier using aggressive negotiation tactics. Without an attorney, an insurance company may try to take advantage of you as an injured bus accident victim. An attorney will not let this happen.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5om",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5og",
          "_type": "link",
