        },
        {
          "_key": "l5oj",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5of",
          "text": "Your lawyer will work for you and no one else. He or she will be just as dedicated to achieving positive results for your case as you are, as ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5oh",
          "text": "your lawyer won’t get paid unless you do",
          "marks": [
            "l5og"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5oi",
          "text": ". You can trust your lawyer to take the steps that are necessary to build the strongest possible ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ok",
          "text": "personal injury claim",
          "marks": [
            "l5oj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ol",
          "text": ", including thoroughly investigating the bus accident, detecting signs of fault, searching for available evidence and hiring expert witnesses. Your attorney will passionately advocate for your best interests while you concentrate on healing.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
