          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5op",
          "text": "The first step toward seeking justice for a bus accident is to identify the cause of the crash. Bus accidents are almost always preventable. They frequently stem from negligent acts or omissions, such as bus driver errors. The top causes of bus accidents are:",
