      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5pf",
          "text": "Colorado is a fault-based car insurance state, meaning anyone who gets injured in a bus accident must determine and prove fault to receive compensation from that person’s insurance company. This includes after an accident involving a city, school, public, charter or party bus.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
