    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qg",
          "text": "These injuries can impact the passengers that were on the bus at the time of the crash as well as the driver or occupants of a motor vehicle that collided with the bus. No matter what type of injury you were diagnosed with, you may be entitled to financial compensation. The insurance company of the person or party that caused the crash may be financially responsible for your medical bills and other losses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qi",
          "text": "What to Do After a Bus Accident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ql",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qk",
          "text": "If you get involved in a bus accident in Denver, it is important to know what steps to take to protect yourself and your legal rights from the beginning. If you can, remain calm and try to take the following actions:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qm",
          "text": "Check yourself and everyone else involved in the crash for injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qo",
          "text": "Render aid to injured parties, if possible.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qq",
          "text": "Call 911 to report the bus accident if no one else has already done so.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qs",
          "text": "Document the crash, including taking photos of the damage at the scene.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qu",
          "text": "Write down everything you can remember about the crash while it is still fresh in your mind.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qw",
          "text": "Write down the name of the bus driver, bus company and bus number.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5qz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5qy",
          "text": "Go to a hospital in Denver for professional care without delay.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5r1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5r0",
          "text": "Call the bus company to file an insurance claim. Do not admit fault for the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5r3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5r2",
          "text": "Do not give an insurance company a recorded statement.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5r5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5r4",
          "text": "Contact a bus accident lawyer for advice before signing anything.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5r7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5r6",
          "text": "A bus accident attorney can carefully review your case and offer legal advice that you can trust. Hiring an attorney can make it easier to take the steps that are necessary to build a claim and move forward from a harmful bus crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5r9",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5r8",
          "text": "Who Can Be Held Liable in a Bus Accident?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5rb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ra",
          "text": "If a negligent bus driver caused your bus accident, the bus company or employer can most likely be held vicariously liable. Vicarious liability is a legal doctrine that holds employers responsible for the negligent actions of their on-duty employees. You may be able to hold a bus company, school or the City of Denver liable for your accident if it was caused by bus driver error.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5rg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5rd",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-product-liability-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5rc",
          "text": "If another driver caused the bus crash, his or her car insurance policy may be responsible for paying for your losses. Another option may be bringing a lawsuit against the manufacturer of a defective or faulty bus part with a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5re",
          "text": "product liability claim",
          "marks": [
            "l5rd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5rf",
          "text": ". An investigation by an attorney can determine the liable party or parties in your bus accident case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ri",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5rh",
          "text": "What Is the Statute of Limitations on a Bus Accident Claim?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5rk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5rj",
          "text": "You must act quickly if you wish to seek compensation for a bus accident in Denver. Colorado has a statute of limitations, or legal time limit, of three years from the date of most motor vehicle accidents. A claim against the government, however, must be brought within just 180 days. If you miss your deadline, you will most likely give up the right to file a claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5rm",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5rl",
          "text": "Speak to a Denver Bus Accident Lawyer for Free Today",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
